cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or the paper, please cite the work below."
title: "Multi-Task PhoBERT for Vietnamese Spam-Review Type Classification: A Controlled Reproduction and a Product-Disjoint Evaluation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Phan"
    given-names: "Bá Song Toàn"
  - family-names: "Trịnh"
    given-names: "Minh Bảo Trân"
  - family-names: "Trần"
    given-names: "Quang Long"
year: 2026
keywords:
  - Vietnamese NLP
  - spam review detection
  - PhoBERT
  - multi-task learning
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  A controlled reproduction of Vietnamese spam-review type classification on
  ViSpamReviews v2, with a locked training protocol, three seeds, a
  product-disjoint evaluation, a verbatim-duplicate audit and an error
  decomposition. The hierarchical multi-task objective does not improve
  macro-F1 over a flat classifier once seeds are averaged.
